00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:58.645
-Alright.
-Mississippi.

00:02:58.645 --> 00:02:59.945
-Alright. Mississippi. Yeah.

00:02:59.945 --> 00:03:01.347
-Yeah. Good answer.

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:03.315
-Dart number two.
-Dart number two.

00:03:03.315 --> 00:03:05.718
